@subsection Overview of frozenbubble

Here is a very basic game of frozebubble.

You control the initial projection vector of the red bubble from the
mouse position.  If the red bubble hits another stationary bubble
which is connected to another then all three bubbles are free moving.

@subsection Interesting aspects of the frozenbubble implmentation

This game uses the collision callbacks to resume movement for a
suspended ball.
